##grflangid 0x01

#GRF name and descriptions
STR_GRF_NAME            :{TITLE} {VERSION}
STR_GRF_DESCRIPTION     :{TITLE} is a simple Newgrf that adds game content related to British Columbia Canada. So far it adds the GMD GF6C, a locomotive specially designed to run on BC Rail's Tumbler Ridge Subdivision between 1983 and 2000, along with the EMD FP59PHI from the West Coast Express communter raik service and a Town Names option that adds BC place names.

#Town Name Name for GUI selction
STR_STYLES       : British Columbia Town Names


#vehicle names
STR_GMD_GF6C_NAME  :GMD GF6C (Electric)
STR_EMD_F59PHI_NAME :EMD FP59PHI (Diesel)
STR_NAME_MAZDA3 :Mazda 3 Hatchback (Gasoline)
